# Release evidence copies generated by archive scripts.
# Keep human-authored README/manifest files visible.
release-evidence/**/test-results/
release-evidence/**/configs/
release-evidence/**/*.json
release-evidence/**/*.xml
release-evidence/**/*.html
!release-evidence/**/README.md
!release-evidence/**/MANIFEST.txt

